{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.org/schema.json",
  "$description": "Pharmacy Expiry Shelf Check — token set derived from the design-system skill's starter, adapted to the SaaS-dashboard reference images (Oripio, SellPilot) for a data-dense pharmacist dashboard.",
  "primitive": {
